  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6804c0ab-fd16-b7db-183b-d9f4f4a01d21"],
 " as its matrix, so it empties the excited state:"
}], "Text",
 CellID->530774412,ExpressionUUID->"77076ae4-09e5-8344-1d3c-83ceaf91d1ae"],

